んありがとう♪\nせいたんはとっても面倒見のいい、カッコいいし、でも可愛い女の子です♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の個別握手会の私服はこれ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもとちょっとちがうでしょ？照(^人^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も寒い中、わざわざ来てくださり有難う御座います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変な天気なのに逢いに来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひきませんように..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいつも来てくださる方や、凄く久しぶりの方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/15/4931727/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして行けないけど応援してくださってる方"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/fil